Depends: ${misc:Depends}, perl (>= 5.20)
Recommends: libio-socket-ssl-perl
Suggests: git | rcs | fossil | subversion | mercurial
Description: system file change tracker with pluggable VCS and notification support
 changetrack-ng tracks changes to system files and directories using a
 pluggable VCS backend (RCS, Git, Fossil, SVN, or Mercurial) and sends
 notifications via email, HTTP webhook, OpenTelemetry (OTLP), or an
 append-only JSON log.
 .
 It combines the per-file flexibility of the original changetrack (last
 maintained 2009) with the modern VCS and package-manager integration
 of etckeeper. Supports systemd timer, cron.hourly, and package manager
 hooks for apt and pacman.
